{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"artibody\">\n<p></p><p>他表示，這些限制使烏軍攔截俄羅斯噴氣動力無人機變得更加困難。</p><p>據澤連斯基稱，由於烏克蘭的攔截系統無法達到足夠速度，部分俄羅斯襲擊因此得以突破防線。</p><p>烏克蘭正就這些限制的具體情況向美國尋求解釋。</p><p>上述消息發佈之際，美國特使史蒂夫·威特科夫和賈裏德·庫什納已抵達莫斯科，與俄羅斯總統弗拉基米爾·普京舉行會談，以推動達成結束烏克蘭戰爭的和平協議。</p> </div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:44:06.357045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:13:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:17:11.655713+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:37:17.099399+00:00","content_hash":"d6be09654d5452fbb75d911e2ac1872a50842832a17add28beda4b11836b6f10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:44:06.357045+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}